#   https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-wq5f-xc86-pv6w
# Our direct sharp is 0.35.5 (patched). The flagged copies are dev/build-only
# transitives: 0.34.5 (pinned exactly by miniflare, the local dev runtime) and
# 0.33.5 (favilib via astro-favicons, whose ^0.33.5 has no later 0.33 release),
# for build-time favicon generation. Neither reaches the workerd production
# runtime. A caret override cannot move them and forcing 0.35.x past their pins
# risks breaking native bindings; the newest miniflare still pins 0.35.2.
# Re-checked 2026-10-22, past the earlier review-by: still pinned, no patched release.
# Review-by: 2026-12-15 (drop once miniflare and astro-favicons take sharp >= 0.35.5).
